  "job_B9.1.3_20251003_114916": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00f0\u00e6t hie gewisslice wieten \u00f0\u00e6t hie na on to \u00f0\u00e6s manegum Hit is awrieten on sancte Paules bocum \u00f0\u00e6tte \u00f0\u00e6s g\u00e6stes w\u00e6s\u00f0m sie lufu & gefea & ryhtwislicu Se \u00f0e \u00f0onne ne giem\u00f0 hw\u00e6\u00f0er he \u00f0a sibbe healde, \u00f0onne forsenc\u00f0 he \u00f0one w\u00e6s\u00f0m his g\u00e6stes. Eft cw\u00e6\u00f0 sanctus Paulus: \u00f0onne betweoxn eow bi\u00f0 yfel anda & geflitu, hu ne beo\u00f0 ge \u00f0onne Ond eft he cu\u00e6\u00f0: Secca\u00f0 sibbe & god to eallum mannum; Butan \u00f0\u00e6re ne m\u00e6g nan man God gesion. Ond eft he manode, & cu\u00e6\u00f0: Geornlice gebinde ge eow tosomne mid anmodnesse & mid sibbe, To \u00f0\u00e6m gebanne \u00f0\u00e6s tohopan nan monn m\u00e6g cunnan, butan he \u00f0ider ierne mid anmodnesse & \u00f0eah wel manige onfo\u00f0 synderlicre giefe, & \u00f0onne ofermodgiende forl\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00f0a giefe \u00f0e mare Sua sua manige do\u00f0, gemidlia\u00f0 hiera giefernesse,& atemia\u00f0 hira lichoman \u00f0\u00e6t hie magon bet Ac se \u00f0e wille ascadan \u00f0a forh\u00e6fdnesse from \u00f0\u00e6re anmodnesse, ge\u00f0ence se \u00f0one cwide \u00f0e se Se tympano bi\u00f0 geworht of drygum felle, & \u00f0\u00e6t fell hlyt, \u00f0onne hit mon slieh\u00f0, & on \u00f0\u00e6m chore Se \u00f0onne se \u00f0e his lichoman swenc\u00f0, & \u00f0a anmodnesse wi\u00f0 his niehstan forl\u00e6t, se here\u00f0 Dryhten Oft eac, \u00f0onne hwone mara wisdom upar\u00e6\u00f0",
